{"id":"n15318-1-5","stage":1,"title":"무궁화 · 木槿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15318-1-5-1","ko":"할머니, 이 손수건에 수놓인 꽃이 뭐예요?","zh":"奶奶，这条手帕上绣的花是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손수건에","meaning":"手帕，手绢","explanation":"손수건：手帕，手绢；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손수건","audio":"/audio/ec50f1992318788ba7a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65102","senseId":"1","lemma":"손수건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수놓인","meaning":"被绣上、绣有","explanation":"수놓이다：被绣上、绣有；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"수놓이다","audio":"/audio/00883a6de514e4d82529.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:수놓이다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"수놓이다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"꽃이","meaning":"花，花朵","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ec50f1992318788b","term":"손수건","zh":"手帕，手绢","audio":"/audio/ec50f1992318788ba7a4.mp3","entryId":"65102","definition":"平时随身携带的、轻薄的小块毛巾。","pronunciation":["손쑤건"]},{"id":"00883a6de514e4d8","term":"수놓이다","zh":"被绣上、绣有","audio":"/audio/00883a6de514e4d82529.mp3","definition":"수놓다（刺绣）的被动形式；本句指手帕上绣着花。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/b83bdf6c9014f4744914.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15318-1-5-2","ko":"이건 할머니가 제일 좋아하는 무궁화라는 꽃이란다.","zh":"这是奶奶最喜欢的木槿花哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할머니가","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무궁화라는","meaning":"木槿，无穷花","explanation":"무궁화：木槿，无穷花；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"무궁화","audio":"/audio/2df5909c5a5f6a933f1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15318","senseId":"1","lemma":"무궁화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽃이란다.","meaning":"花，花朵；表示引用。","explanation":"꽃：花，花朵；하다：表示引用。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"꽃","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62838","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"2df5909c5a5f6a93","term":"무궁화","zh":"木槿，无穷花","audio":"/audio/2df5909c5a5f6a933f1d.mp3","entryId":"15318","definition":"一种夏秋季节盛开的花，花瓣呈白、紫、红等颜色，并向外展开，呈钟形。","pronunciation":["무궁화"]},{"id":"1543c99e8fd9f44d","term":"꽃","zh":"花，花朵","audio":"/audio/1543c99e8fd9f44ded8e.mp3","entryId":"62838","definition":"长在植物茎干顶端的一部分，具有特有的模样、颜色和香气；或指会开此物的植物。","pronunciation":["꼳"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/edbf5dad229f61aae7cf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.608,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15318","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3333,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["奶奶，这条手帕上绣的花是什么呀？","这是奶奶最喜欢的木槿花哦。","怎么突然停下脚步站住了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["奶奶，这条手帕上绣的花是什么呀？","这是奶奶最喜欢的木槿花哦。","怎么突然停下脚步站住了？"],"answer":1}]}
